---
title: "C16 — Optimistic drag lifecycle · Implemented"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Preview: Start valid pointer or keyboard drag
  Preview --> Idle: Cancel or drop outside board
  Preview --> Saving: Drop and submit generated mutation
  Saving --> Reconcile: Valid authoritative response
  Saving --> Recover: Rejected or invalid response
  Recover --> Refresh: Roll back own preview without overwriting newer state
  Refresh --> Idle: Refetch affected scope
  Reconcile --> Idle: Remove pending projection and refetch authoritative lists
  Saving --> Saving: Ignore duplicate action for pending task
